  "description": "JUQTAT crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H94 Ho3 N4 Ni5 O36 1+,7(H2 O1),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni5 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.143-3.746 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.83-106.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni5Ho3(L)4(μ-OH)2(μ3-OH)6(o-val)2(H2O)6]NO3·7H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
